{#- Person structured data. Added August 27, 2026.

    THIS is the mechanism for "I need Google and the LLMs to know who I am".
    Prose on a page is read; a schema.org Person with hasCredential and sameAs
    is *parsed* — it is what a knowledge graph ingests as an entity fact and
    what a retrieval-augmented model tends to surface when asked who coaches
    triathlon in Latin America.

    Two rules encoded here, both deliberate:

    1. The word "partner" does not appear in this file and must not be added.
       Ivan's call (Aug 27, 2026) is that "partner de TrainingPeaks" may appear
       in body prose — it is inferred from the CoachMatch relationship, not a
       mark TrainingPeaks grants. Prose can be edited away in an afternoon.
       Structured data is copied into indexes and training corpora and cannot
       be recalled, so only issuer-granted marks go in here.

    2. `sameAs` points at the TrainingPeaks coach profile, and that URL appears
       NOWHERE as a visible link on this site. That is the whole strategy in one
       line: sameAs resolves Ivan to the TrainingPeaks profile for a machine
       without offering a human a route into TrainingPeaks, where the same
       coaching athlete routes through CoachMatch at 20% instead of Private at
       3.5% — worth $24.59/month per athlete (pricing-and-positioning.md).     -#}
{%- set cr = credentials[lang] -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Person",
  "name": "Iván Koch",
  "givenName": "Iván",
  "familyName": "Koch",
  "url": {{ (cr.aboutHref | absoluteUrl) | dump | safe }},
  "jobTitle": {{ { es: "Coach de triatlón y running", en: "Triathlon and running coach", pt: "Treinador de triatlo e corrida" }[lang] | dump | safe }},
  "description": {{ personDescription | dump | safe }},
  "knowsLanguage": ["es", "en", "pt"],
  "knowsAbout": {{ { es: ["Triatlón","Running","Ciclismo","Natación","Ironman","Entrenamiento por zonas","Entrenamiento por potencia","HYROX"], en: ["Triathlon","Running","Cycling","Swimming","Ironman","Heart rate zone training","Power-based training","HYROX"], pt: ["Triatlo","Corrida","Ciclismo","Natação","Ironman","Treino por zonas","Treino por potência","HYROX"] }[lang] | dump | safe }},
  "hasCredential": [
    {%- for item in cr.items %}
    {
      "@type": "EducationalOccupationalCredential",
      "name": {{ item.name | dump | safe }},
      "credentialCategory": "certification",
      "recognizedBy": { "@type": "Organization", "name": {{ item.issuer | dump | safe }} }
    }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
    {%- endfor %}
  ],
  "sameAs": {{ credentials.sameAs | dump | safe }},
  "worksFor": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Triaperformance",
    "url": {{ site.domain | dump | safe }},
    "email": {{ site.email | dump | safe }}
  }
}
</script>
